# Committed on purpose: every value here is public by design.
# - The Supabase URL and anon (publishable) key ship to every browser;
#   RLS is the security boundary, and there is no service-role key anywhere.
# - ADMIN_EMAIL already appears in the RLS migration.
# - Sheet IDs are link-identifiers, not credentials.
# The ONLY secret is GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY, which lives solely in
# Vercel project env vars, never in the repo.

